WEBVTT

00:11:29.518 --> 00:11:33.981
guardians are helping honor
our responsibility to the land.

00:11:34.481 --> 00:11:37.985
And the benefits,
they ripple far and wide.

00:11:38.026 --> 00:11:43.365
As Gloria Enzo, a Ni Hat’Ni Dene guardian
from the Northwest Territory says,

00:11:43.407 --> 00:11:45.576
"We are sustaining
our traditional territories

00:11:45.617 --> 00:11:47.244
not only for us,

00:11:47.286 --> 00:11:49.121
but for the whole world."

00:11:50.122 --> 00:11:53.625
By honoring and respecting
Indigenous-led approaches to the land,

00:11:53.625 --> 00:11:57.171
we can create a better future for all.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:01.008
You know, there's a role
for everyone in this model.